	)
	(gr_text_box "Notes:\n\nDesigned for 1-layer, no plating, no soldermask, no silkscreen for rapid prototyping.\n\nDesign has 2 layers (1 non-functional) for increased manufacturing options.\n\nIntended to be manufactured using LPKF equipment at the HIVE Makerspace\n(LPKF Protomat S103 & LPKF Protolaser U4)\n\nHIVE Makerspace capabilities:\n\n2 Layers only (1.6 mm FR4)\nNo Through-Hole Plating\nNo Soldermask\nNo Silkscreen\nMinimum Via size (wire): 0.4 mm (hole) 1.0 mm (pad)\nMinimum Via size (rivet): 0.8 mm (hole) 1.4 mm (pad)\nDrill hit: 0.15 mm (min) | 0.3 mm (typ)\nCopper isolation: 0.05 mm (min) | 0.1 mm (typ)"
		(start 95 25)
		(end 185 80)
		(margins 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "ef07b210-cd1b-4f4a-b0e6-b5d9e773ec16")
